        "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/140322_Unzen_Onsen_Nagasaki_pref_Japan01s3.jpg/3840px-140322_Unzen_Onsen_Nagasaki_pref_Japan01s3.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"
